WHERE THE CODE COMES FROM
- plugins/sammi.reverb/reverb.c: Hundekraft's ext/kennel/synth_sdk/plugins/reverb/reverb.c (the Elements reverb's
  fixed-point port, through op1r), Hundekraft OP-1 Workshop source 3.1.1
  (https://github.com/Hundekraft/op1-workshop, source/hundekraft-3.1.1-source.tar.gz, sha256
  831f0aa0c4d06e39ee3f3cdadd6a3c44426910d0e56a76b39490169ccb299f9e; the file's sha256 3a9064ba...6d72, as the
  archive's PROVENANCE.json records it). Original code (c) 2014 Emilie Gillet, MIT (LICENSE.elements).
- plugins/sammi.stutter/stutter.c: Hundekraft's ext/kennel/synth_sdk/plugins/stutter/stutter.c, the same archive
  (sha256 234660de...b441). The beat clock reader follows kennel's op1_plugin.h (op1_beat_clock).
- third_party/: the two original files and their plugin.json manifests, unchanged, for reference and for the tests.
- tests/host/harness/op1_host.h: op1r-src's host mocks (pcppcp), unchanged, as carried by Project_Hollow_Saint.
- tests/bfin_sim/start.S and sim.ld: from Project_Hollow_Saint (the hollow_saint authors, GPL-3.0-or-later). The
  repository builds no compiler: it uses the shared toolchain (~/mnt/Documents/op1-toolchain, built by the Opus
  kit's own recipe); the git-source toolchain scripts it once carried (tools/toolchain/) were removed.
- The Opus 2 headers (opus_plugin.h, op1fw.h) and plugin_tool.py are LizardMan's Opus plugin kit
  (https://github.com/LizardMan245/opus, plugin-kit, GPL-3.0); they are used to build, not copied here.

MODIFICATIONS (GPL-3.0 section 5): what was changed against Hundekraft's files, and why, is listed at the top of each
plugin source and in docs/MODIFICATIONS.md, with the full diffs in docs/diffs/. Modified 2026-11-01.

NOT INCLUDED, NOT COVERED
No Teenage Engineering firmware, firmware image, device key, NAND image, font or artwork is in this repository or its
release archives. The STUTTER plugin reads (never writes) three words of the running firmware's RAM at firmware 246's
addresses, as kennel does. Hundekraft's screen artwork (kalireverb.svg, by DAN76; stutter.svg) is not used: the
plugins draw through the Opus effect page. Not affiliated with or endorsed by Teenage Engineering, Hundekraft or
